  "releaseNotes": "- Updated TabControl names to remove Control to match existing controls\n      - Renamed TabControlParams to TabForm\n    - Fixed suffix for several EventArgs to match existing patterns\n    - Added DataPageView HasNext and HasPrevious DataBinding\n    - Removed [Params] and added TabModel.AddForm()\n    - Renamed [Static] to [CloneReference] to better reflect usage\n    - Added [DeprecatedName(\"OldName\")] to allow deserializing deprecated field and property names\n    - Added struct support for several attributes to match class support\n    - Rolled Svg.Controls.Skia.Avalonia back to an older Avalonia.Svg.Skia due to older Linux and WebAssembly compatibility issues\n    - Added Process Monitor Tab to the Sample Charts\n    - Added ChartView.ShowNowTime to control showing the chart now time annotation\n    - Improved LiveCharts handling when there's no data points",
